WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.010
Chapter 5 · the last one in Unit 1!

2
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:10.630
Computers · Binary · Devices · Websites

3
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:12.990
Chapter 5 · Being Safe Online

4
00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:16.610
3 super safety rules

5
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:23.860
"Hi! I'm 10 too. Want to be friends?"

6
00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:29.770
Can you see who is really typing?

7
00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:37.020
Online, anyone can pretend to be anyone

8
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:41.380
Smart champs follow 3 rules

9
00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.950
Rule 1: Private info stays private

10
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:48.630
Full name · School · Home address · Phone number

11
00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:55.180
Together, they make a map to your door!

12
00:00:55.180 --> 00:01:01.980
OK to share: favourite colour, nickname, drawing

13
00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:04.840
Say it: Private stays private!

14
00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:10.380
Game: Safe or unsafe?

15
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:13.800
Post 1: "I love mango ice cream!"

16
00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.590
SAFE! Anyone can know that

17
00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:22.180
Post 2: name + school + street

18
00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:28.430
UNSAFE! That's a map to Riya's door

19
00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:31.740
Post 3: "Look at my new drawing!"

20
00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:36.290
SAFE! (no school badge or house number)

21
00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.930
Rule 2: Your password is a secret key

22
00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:42.400
It locks your games and accounts

23
00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:48.110
Secret, even from friends. Only parents know.

24
00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:52.600
Weak: 1234 or your name

25
00:01:52.600 --> 00:02:00.510
Strong: long + words + numbers + symbols

26
00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.340
Make your OWN. Never copy one from a screen.

27
00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:11.170
Which is stronger? abc123 or BlueKite!Runs42

28
00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:16.610
B! Longer + mixed = harder to guess

29
00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:20.160
Rule 3: Odd chat? Tell a trusted adult

30
00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:27.680
Red flags: photos, where you live, "don't tell"

31
00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:34.160
Stop → Don't reply → Tell a grown-up

32
00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:38.570
Mum or Dad · Teacher · Nani & Nana

33
00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:43.010
You're never in trouble for telling

34
00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.060
Practice check

35
00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:58.510
A new online friend asks for your address…

36
00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:04.920
C: Don't share. Tell a trusted adult.

37
00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:09.240
Rule 1: Private info stays private

38
00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:12.600
Rule 2: Passwords are secret

39
00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:18.070
Rule 3: Stop, don't reply, tell an adult

40
00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:22.730
Never post: full name · school · home address

41
00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:27.670
Unit 1 complete!

42
